{"id":"n80029-1-8","stage":5,"title":"태몽 · 胎梦","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80029-1-8-1","ko":"아빠, 저는 태몽이 뭐였어요?","zh":"爸爸，怀我时家里做过什么胎梦？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아빠,","meaning":"爸爸","explanation":"아빠：爸爸","readings":[{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26148","senseId":"1","lemma":"아빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}},{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저는","audio":"/audio/0b05af6c0b14d6e70820.mp3"}},{"text":"태몽이","meaning":"胎梦","explanation":"태몽：胎梦；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"태몽","audio":"/audio/1123796438e3a666e9b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80029","senseId":"1","lemma":"태몽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"태몽이","audio":"/audio/866721c05ddb24505b34.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐였어요?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐였어요","audio":"/audio/c1e085efa17d91b1972e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c9f209994786f50d","term":"아빠","zh":"爸爸","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3","entryId":"26148","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼父亲。","pronunciation":["아빠"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"1123796438e3a666","term":"태몽","zh":"胎梦","audio":"/audio/1123796438e3a666e9b0.mp3","entryId":"80029","definition":"预示即将要怀孕的梦。","pronunciation":["태몽"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/4e3b193c0f59321dec37.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80029-1-8-2","ko":"커다란 잉어를 잡는 꿈을 꾸었단다.","zh":"梦见抓到了一条大鲤鱼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"커다란","meaning":"很大，巨大","explanation":"커다랗다：很大，巨大；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"커다랗다","audio":"/audio/96ead858a45ebd1d3bee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72164","senseId":"1","lemma":"커다랗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"커다란","audio":"/audio/11341b9bd6ff272ea278.mp3"}},{"text":"잉어를","meaning":"鲤鱼","explanation":"잉어：鲤鱼；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"잉어","audio":"/audio/2ab3cb3f435b8163c9fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73765","senseId":"1","lemma":"잉어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잉어를","audio":"/audio/e3a8fdf8c36527857f83.mp3"}},{"text":"잡는","meaning":"抓，捕","explanation":"잡다：抓，捕；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"잡다","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70378","senseId":"2","lemma":"잡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잡는","audio":"/audio/82b47c5a814aecd3040f.mp3"}},{"text":"꿈을","meaning":"梦","explanation":"꿈：梦；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"꿈","audio":"/audio/30fb5e8ccd7b82b30b61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57279","senseId":"1","lemma":"꿈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꿈을","audio":"/audio/f1b8deab36046ef08295.mp3"}},{"text":"꾸었단다.","meaning":"做；表示引用。","explanation":"꾸다：做；하다：表示引用。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"꾸다","audio":"/audio/ea4054f32b1e1745e6a4.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62352","senseId":"1","lemma":"꾸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"22","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꾸었단다","audio":"/audio/64c641560026b8b19cfd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"96ead858a45ebd1d","term":"커다랗다","zh":"很大，巨大","audio":"/audio/96ead858a45ebd1d3bee.mp3","entryId":"72164","definition":"非常大。","pronunciation":["커ː다라타"]},{"id":"2ab3cb3f435b8163","term":"잉어","zh":"鲤鱼","audio":"/audio/2ab3cb3f435b8163c9fd.mp3","entryId":"73765","definition":"一般背部深蓝，腹部浅黄，身形较大，嘴边有两对胡须的淡水鱼。","pronunciation":["잉ː어"]},{"id":"b8cc8df3de72c173","term":"잡다","zh":"抓，捕","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3","entryId":"70378","definition":"捉住放在手里。","pronunciation":["잡따"]},{"id":"30fb5e8ccd7b82b3","term":"꿈","zh":"梦","audio":"/audio/30fb5e8ccd7b82b30b61.mp3","entryId":"57279","definition":"指睡觉期间有着和清醒时一样的视听感觉的精神现象。","pronunciation":["꿈"]},{"id":"ea4054f32b1e1745","term":"꾸다","zh":"做","audio":"/audio/ea4054f32b1e1745e6a4.mp3","entryId":"62352","definition":"睡觉时在梦中像现实生活一样看、听、感觉。","pronunciation":["꾸다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示引用。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示引用。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/888d919631977dcbd71a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.3,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80029","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":157,"sequenceScore":3.1267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["爸爸，怀我时家里做过什么胎梦？","梦见抓到了一条大鲤鱼。","你怎么一直嚼饭，却不咽下去？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["爸爸，怀我时家里做过什么胎梦？","梦见抓到了一条大鲤鱼。","你怎么一直嚼饭，却不咽下去？"],"answer":1}]}
